      `${leaveExample.totalWorked} days worked → ${mdl(leaveExample.perWorkedDay)} per day worked.`,
      `Coefficient ${leaveExample.totalWorking} / ${leaveExample.totalCalendar} → ${mdl(leaveExample.perCalendarDay)} per calendar day.`,
      `Gross leave pay: ${mdl(leaveExample.gross)}.`,
    ],
    sickExampleTitle: "10 days of sick leave, record over 8 years",
